aft Rhenania\">Burschenschaft Rhenania</td>\n<td>4. Juni 1920\n</td>\n<td class=\"hintergrundfarbe5\" style=\"text-align:center;\" data-sort-value=\"blau-gold-violett\">\n<table class=\"centered\" style=\"width:60px; border: 1px solid; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:blue; height:9px\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:gold; height:9px\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:darkviolet; height:9px\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table> blau-gold-violett\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%A4nnerbund\" title=\"Männerbund\">Männer</a>\n</td>\n<td>WS 1922/23 nach Oldenburg verlegt\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Burschenschaft Hansea\">Burschenschaft Hansea</td>\n<td>1920\n</td>\n<td class=\"hintergrundfarbe5\" style=\"text-align:center;\" data-sort-value=\"schwarz-silber-blau\">\n<table class=\"centered\" style=\"width:60px; border: 1px solid; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:black; height:9px\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:silver; height:9px\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background:blue; height:9px\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table> schwarz-silber-blau\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Datei:Burschenschaft_Hansea_Wismar.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Burschenschaft_Hansea_Wismar.jpg/40px-Burschenschaft_Hansea_Wismar.jpg?utm_source=de.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"44\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Burschenschaft_Hansea_Wismar.jpg/120px-Burschenschaft_Hansea_Wismar.jpg?utm_source=de.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"122\" data-file